#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:5 0f1998b60e9e43b8956e24c24505ab92
msgid "DShot ESCs"
msgstr "DShot ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:9 4962ac509fa349ff811f61d87ac79d98
msgid ""
"DShot is a digital ESC protocol which allows fast, high resolution digital "
"communication which may improve vehicle control which is especially useful "
"in multirotor and quadplane applications.  Other advantages include"
msgstr "DShot是一种数字ESC协议，允许快速、高分辨率的数字通信，可改善飞行器控制，在多旋翼和QuadPlane应用中尤为有用。其他优势包括"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:11 2b46b3e8b8fe4db38656062c5381daad
msgid "Values sent to the ESC are checksum-protected"
msgstr "发送到ESC的数值受校验和保护"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:12 9de8f6b4b138449eacbde9bf8c237c30
msgid ""
"Clock differences between the ESC and autopilot don't affect flight "
"performance"
msgstr "ESC与飞控之间的时钟差异不影响飞行性能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:13 a1620fccf96846afa342bd764b22c30b
msgid "ESC calibration is not required"
msgstr "无需ESC校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:15 4429a42a69474151be6929804e666139
msgid ""
"DShot is the underlying ESC control protocol used by :ref:`BLHeli/AM32 "
"<common-blheli32-passthru>` ESCs.  Many BLHeli/AM32 ESC versions offer even "
"more features such as ESC configuration, :ref:`ESC telemetry <blheli32-esc-"
"telemetry>`, LED control and/or :ref:`Bi-directional dshot <bidir-dshot>`.  "
"If choosing a DShot enabled ESC we recommend using one that also supports "
"BLHeli32, AM32, or BLHeli_S."
msgstr ""
"DShot是 :ref:`BLHeli/AM32 <common-blheli32-passthru>` "
"ESC使用的底层ESC控制协议。许多BLHeli/AM32 ESC版本提供更多功能，如ESC配置、:ref:`ESC遥测 <blheli32-esc-"
"telemetry>`、LED控制和/或 :ref:`双向DShot <bidir-"
"dshot>`。若选择支持DShot的ESC，我们建议使用同时支持BLHeli32、AM32或BLHeli_S的型号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:18 e3a4d854158643fc8ab455f6c7d2bd67
msgid ""
"Only try DShot on ESCs that are known to support it or you will get "
"unpredictable results."
msgstr "仅在已知支持DShot的ESC上尝试，否则会得到不可预知的结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:21 9824101adb7a4bb29ef8a34b95a9b95b
msgid ""
"Recently there is a growing number of proprietary and non-proprietary 16 / "
"32 bit ESCs with firmware that support DShot and other digital ESC "
"protocols, but not BLHeli32/AM32 specific features like passthrough and "
"telemetry. See your ESC's manual for further detail on supported features."
msgstr ""
"近年来，越来越多的专有和非专有16/32位ESC固件支持DShot和其他数字ESC协议，但不支持BLHeli32/AM32特定功能（如直通和遥测）。详见您ESC的说明书了解支持的功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:23 b10f98cfcde34b5b98f79793e6ec57fd
msgid ""
"most DShot ESCs normally will also operate as normal :ref:`PWM ESCs <common-"
"brushless-escs>`."
msgstr "大多数DShot ESC通常也可作为普通 :ref:`PWM ESC <common-brushless-escs>` 操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:28 ef604f7570bc45d59eb3233d5cc55dbc
msgid "Connecting the ESCs"
msgstr "连接ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:30 6b9848d5d3a8435cab0e0ae4b9585c05
msgid ""
"For firmware versions prior to 4.5, autopilots with an IOMCU co-processor "
"(e.g. Pixhawk, CubeOrange,etc.) the DShot ESCs should be connected to the "
"AUX outputs and not the MAIN outputs of the IOMCU co-processor. In firmware "
"versions 4.5 or later, the :ref:`BRD_IO_DSHOT<BRD_IO_DSHOT>` parameter may "
"be set to load Dshot compatible IOMCU firmware on the next bootup for some "
"autopilots using F103 IOMCUs. If this parameter is not present, then the "
"autopilot does not have DShot capability on its IOMCU outoputs. See the "
":ref:`IOMCU Dshot Limitations <iomcu-dshot>` section for limitations and "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"4.5版本之前的固件，对于带IOMCU协处理器的飞控（如Pixhawk、CubeOrange等），DShot "
"ESC应连接到AUX输出而非IOMCU协处理器的MAIN输出。4.5及更高版本固件中，对于某些使用F103 "
"IOMCU的飞控，:ref:`BRD_IO_DSHOT<BRD_IO_DSHOT>` "
"参数可设置为在下次启动时加载兼容DShot的IOMCU固件。若此参数不存在，则该飞控的IOMCU输出不支持DShot。详见 :ref:`IOMCU "
"Dshot限制 <iomcu-dshot>` 章节了解限制和更多信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:32 3c0645595dbc44e9a1ce767b2a88b8f7
msgid ""
"On CubeOrange DShot works on all channels.  AUX1 cannot be used for Bi-"
"Directional DShot meaning only AUX2 to AUX6 can be used for Bi_directional "
"DShot.  (`see issue "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/20362>`__)."
msgstr ""
"在CubeOrange上，DShot适用于所有通道。AUX1不能用于双向DShot，因此仅AUX2至AUX6可用于双向DShot。（`参见问题 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/20362>`__）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:34 1438ae84a83d47f5b42c6f41e53023f4
msgid ""
"For :ref:`other boards <common-autopilots>` without a separate IOMCU "
"coprocessor, any servo/motor outputs can be used for DShot."
msgstr "对于 :ref:`其他没有独立IOMCU协处理器的控制板 <common-autopilots>`，任何舵机/电机输出均可用于DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:36 9a83365b86f44019bc1560d843500f7d
msgid ""
"Please see the :ref:`Mixing ESC Protocols <dshot-mixing-escs>` section below"
" for more details on limitations"
msgstr "详见下方 :ref:`混合ESC协议 <dshot-mixing-escs>` 章节了解更多限制详情"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:39 e7fe26420cec4c71a01674e83bae7ec3
msgid "BiDirectional DShot"
msgstr "双向DShot"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:41 8a72daf1a3874d1ca3034f2ca4535f73
msgid "Some boards"
msgstr "某些控制板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:44 82b8f61486f64ff5aee09e530357e422
msgid "Select the DShot baud rate"
msgstr "选择DShot波特率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:47 9151695db882405c8f84e0ea009c26b0
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE <MOT_PWM_TYPE>` for the desired baud rate and reboot "
"the autopilot"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE <MOT_PWM_TYPE>` 为期望的波特率并重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:51 d95027fc7e3340aba0318637b3aab6f3
msgid ""
"DShot150 at 150kbaud (recommended for larger aircraft with long signal lead "
"runs)"
msgstr "DShot150，150kbaud（推荐用于信号线较长的大型飞行器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:52 9457ca0257b84a9c851d306f9470a540
msgid "DShot300 at 300kbaud"
msgstr "DShot300，300kbaud"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:53 f1cb1af0f2e54e25beb168a7dab45bcc
msgid "DShot600 at 600kbaud (recommended for most vehicles)"
msgstr "DShot600，600kbaud（推荐用于大多数飞行器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:54 1f75f839250c40f2966ec6351ae20b42
msgid "DShot1200 at 1200kbaud"
msgstr "DShot1200，1200kbaud"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:56 3351476e5a9d4fa69aba6c19ee75fd69
msgid ""
"For larger aircraft with longer cable runs using DShot ESC protocol, we "
"recommend using the lowest baud rate, DShot150, as it is the most reliable "
"protocol (lower baudrates are less susceptible to noise on cables)."
msgstr ""
"对于使用DShot "
"ESC协议且线缆较长的大型飞行器，我们建议使用最低波特率DShot150，因为它是最可靠的协议（较低波特率对线缆上的噪声不那么敏感）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:58 0ca1f724c06c461db3c9b5ace845922d
msgid ""
"For smaller craft, DShot600 is by far the most widely used and can therefore"
" be a more suitable choice simply because of the amount of testing that it "
"has had, rather than the newer DShot1200 protocol."
msgstr ""
"对于小型飞行器，DShot600是迄今为止使用最广泛的，因此可能是更合适的选择——原因在于它经过了大量测试，而不是因为比更新的DShot1200协议更好。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:60 d29f76c4bbd644f581574fa9ba07b67e
msgid ""
"Higher rates (e.g. DShot600 and DShot1200) are more susceptible to noise but"
" have the advantage that they tie up the allocated DMA channel for less time"
" which can be beneficial on autopilots with a lot of DMA sharing."
msgstr "较高速率（如DShot600和DShot1200）对噪声更敏感，但优点是占用DMA通道的时间更短，这在DMA共享较多的飞控上有优势。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:62 9730b84eb64d4065b98621ecec5ca7c4
msgid ""
"If :ref:`Bi-directional DShot <bidir-dshot>` will be used, DShot300 and "
"DShot600 are preferred, because this feature requires a longer pulse width "
"as it has to wait for the response from the ESC before it can send another "
"pulse.  Bi-directional DShot does not share DMA channels and so there is no "
"impact on other peripherals.  Bi-directional DShot is only supported on "
"BLHeli32/AM32 ESCs"
msgstr ""
"若将使用 :ref:`双向DShot <bidir-"
"dshot>`，首选DShot300和DShot600，因为该功能需要更长的脉冲宽度——它必须等待ESC的响应才能发送下一个脉冲。双向DShot不共享DMA通道，因此对其他外设没有影响。双向DShot仅在BLHeli32/AM32"
" ESC上受支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:65 84fdc8cce754497083d9da6ea74cca8e
msgid "Configure the Servo Functions"
msgstr "配置舵机功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:67 41ae6b6e90ae4eea85757aa268e9cd9b
msgid ""
"As mentioned above, if using an autopilot with an IOMCU (e.g. Pixhawk, "
"CubeOrange,etc.) the ESCs should be connected to the AUX outputs instead of "
"the default MAIN outputs.  This in turn means that the corresponding "
":ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` parameters must be updated so the "
"autopilot knows which output is connected to the ESCs/motors.   This can be "
"most easily done using Mission Planner's \"Servo Output\" page"
msgstr ""
"如上所述，若使用带IOMCU的飞控（如Pixhawk、CubeOrange等），ESC应连接到AUX输出而非默认的MAIN输出。这意味着必须相应更新 "
":ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` "
"参数，使飞控知道哪个输出连接到ESC/电机。最简便的方法是使用Mission Planner的「Servo Output」页面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:71 904506b4d17c4aef9ab1a7795f506465
msgid ""
"When an output is configured for DShot, the ``SERVOx_MIN/MAX/TRIM`` "
"parameters for that output will always be ignored since DShot does not use "
"these parameters. The trim  value used will be  1500 if it's a reversible "
"output, or 1000 if normal output setup in DShot, and the output range always"
" be 1000-2000. No ESC calibration step is required."
msgstr ""
"当输出配置为DShot时，该输出的 ``SERVOx_MIN/MAX/TRIM`` "
"参数将始终被忽略，因为DShot不使用这些参数。若为可反转输出则使用1500的微调值，若为正常输出则使用1000，输出范围始终为1000-2000。无需ESC校准步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:75 0c7798f5ce5e40499d0eb5c9ec337cce
msgid ""
"All mask-based configuration can only be changed at a PWM group level, "
"please consult the documentation for your autopilot to ascertain which "
"outputs are on different groups. See :ref:`Mixing ESC Protocols <dshot-"
"mixing-escs>` section below."
msgstr ""
"所有基于掩码的配置只能在PWM组级别更改，请查阅您飞控的文档以确定哪些输出在不同的组中。参见下方 :ref:`混合ESC协议 <dshot-"
"mixing-escs>` 章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:77 539e6264e16b4322b97c40161379e0c5
msgid ""
"Be sure your ESC can support the configuration you select for it. Damage can"
" occur otherwise. This includes frame rates discussed below. Also be careful"
" when switching between digital and analogue output types without re-"
"calibrating ESCs as this can lead to uncommanded motor output."
msgstr ""
"确保您的ESC支持您为其选择的配置，否则可能造成损坏。这包括下面讨论的帧率。同时，在不重新校准ESC的情况下切换数字和模拟输出类型时要小心，这可能导致意外的电机输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:80 bce35e2c0fa24b698cd41cae9850cff8
msgid "Check the RC Banner"
msgstr "检查RC Banner"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:82 b68f2b35524f4f6aa1faa1223524cf3d
msgid ""
"Reboot the autopilot and check the \"RC banner\" to confirm the output "
