#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:112
#: 86aef56b45fb4e6aa9f75eacfdc39c96
msgid ""
"Currently, ArduPilot supports the command set "
"(:ref:`SERVO_DSHOT_ESC<SERVO_DSHOT_ESC>` =1) that is commonly used, however,"
" others are appearing and may not be compatible, resulting in undefined "
"operation. Use caution (remove blades!) until correct operation using type=1"
" is verified for your ESC"
msgstr ""
"目前，ArduPilot 支持常用的指令集（:ref:`SERVO_DSHOT_ESC<SERVO_DSHOT_ESC>` "
"=1），但其他类型正在出现且可能不兼容，导致未定义操作。在确认 type=1 对您的电调正常运行之前，请谨慎使用（拆下桨叶！）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:117
#: 6024b01940654e71a21d51f443b1bba2
msgid "Reversible DShot ESCs"
msgstr "可逆 DShot 电调"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:119
#: 4ddf5a611ab74c94b7bba6be92b6477a
msgid ""
"Reversible DShot (aka 3D mode) allows the motor to be spun in either "
"direction which is important for Rover, Boats and :ref:`Planes with reverse "
"thrust <plane:reverse-thrust-setup>`."
msgstr ""
"可逆 DShot（即 3D 模式）允许电机向任意方向旋转，这对于 Rover、船只以及 :ref:`带反推力的固定翼 <plane:reverse-"
"thrust-setup>` 非常重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:121
#: 96c3c04fc43f471eacccb0a1634885cd
msgid ""
"Currently, only BLHeli32, AM32, and BLHeli_S capable reversible DShot ESCs "
"are supported. In order to use one, the output which drives it must be "
"designated with the appropriate bit in the "
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_3DMASK<SERVO_BLH_3DMASK>` bitmask parameter. This will map "
"the outputs 1000-1500-2000 values to the correct digital values for the ESC "
"to provide FullReverse-Idle-FullForward range operation, respectively."
msgstr ""
"目前，仅支持 BLHeli32、AM32 和 BLHeli_S 的可逆 DShot 电调。使用时，驱动该电调的输出须在 "
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_3DMASK<SERVO_BLH_3DMASK>` 位掩码参数中设置对应位。这将把输出的 1000-1500-2000 "
"数值映射为电调的正确数字值，以实现全反转-怠速-全正转的范围操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:123
#: ead9886a1c6d45c5abf61318486e57d4
msgid ""
"If :ref:`DShot commands <dshot-commands>` have been enabled then ArduPilot "
"will automatically configure the ESCs to reversible mode (3D mode) at "
"startup, according to the :ref:`SERVO_BLH_3DMASK<SERVO_BLH_3DMASK>`. "
"Enabling :ref:`DShot commands <dshot-commands>` will allow the other DShot "
"commands to be sent to any other ESC configured as DShot by the DShot mask "
"parameters discussed in :ref:`DShot setup instructions <common-dshot-escs>`."
msgstr ""
"若已启用 :ref:`DShot 指令 <dshot-commands>`，ArduPilot 将在启动时根据 "
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_3DMASK<SERVO_BLH_3DMASK>` 自动将电调配置为可逆模式（3D 模式）。启用 :ref:`DShot"
" 指令 <dshot-commands>` 还允许将其他 DShot 指令发送给由 :ref:`DShot 设置说明 <common-dshot-"
"escs>` 中讨论的 DShot 掩码参数配置为 DShot 的任意其他电调。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:125
#: 8fabd08882324ba08597e95521f17ff4
msgid ""
"Otherwise, you must manually configure the ESCs' \"Motor Direction\" to "
"\"Bidirectional 3D\" as shown below."
msgstr "否则，您必须手动将电调的「电机方向」配置为「双向 3D」，如下所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:131
#: 779abc8a33c249d68b09b335d8821145
msgid ""
"Currently, ArduPilot only supports the use of reversible ESCs for Plane and "
"Rover, not Copter."
msgstr "目前，ArduPilot 仅支持在固定翼和 Rover 上使用可逆电调，不支持多旋翼飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:137
#: 6d20c4edd398475380611d295c3f406e
msgid "Mixing ESC Protocols"
msgstr "混合使用 ESC 协议"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:139
#: 5c3231979fa746458ac3a53d8dc86d45
msgid ""
"While all the servo/motor outputs of an ArduPilot autopilot are capable of "
"Normal PWM operation at 50Hz and higher frame rates, not all are capable of "
"other ESC protocol configurations. And, usually, these configurations must "
"apply to pre-designated groups of outputs, even if they are not all driving "
"an ESC. So the following cautions apply:"
msgstr ""
"虽然 ArduPilot 飞控的所有舵机/电机输出均可在 50Hz 及更高帧率下进行普通 PWM "
"操作，但并非所有输出都支持其他电调协议配置。而且，通常这些配置必须应用于预先指定的一组输出，即使它们并非全部驱动电调。因此需注意以下事项："

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:141
#: c9a4838cdc144ac495a1d71b5e0344bd
msgid ""
"The 8 \"MAIN\" outputs of autopilots using an IOMCU (like PixHawk and Cube),"
" cannot be used for DShot. On these autopilots, only the additional \"AUX\" "
"outputs support DShot. If you attempt to set a \"MAIN\" output to DShot, "
"then normal PWM output will occur, even though it has been set to a DShot "
"protocol."
msgstr ""
"使用 IOMCU 的飞控（如 PixHawk 和 Cube）的 8 个「MAIN」输出不能用于 DShot。这类飞控上，只有附加的「AUX」输出支持 "
"DShot。如果您尝试将「MAIN」输出设置为 DShot，即使已设置为 DShot 协议，实际仍会输出普通 PWM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:143
#: 1e6cb972b92f4fb6a5519c15c8503197
msgid ""
"For :ref:`Pixracer <common-pixracer-overview>` and :ref:`other boards "
"<common-autopilots>` without a separate IOMCU coprocessor, all servo/motor "
"outputs can be used."
msgstr ""
"对于 :ref:`Pixracer <common-pixracer-overview>` 和其他没有独立 IOMCU 协处理器的 :ref:`飞控 "
"<common-autopilots>`，所有舵机/电机输出均可使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:145
#: 6b6fd2c4392a47f2a004bffdf5abf4de
msgid ""
"Groups of outputs sharing a common timer, MUST have the same advanced "
"configuration. Usually, these are specified in the autopilot's hardware "
"description linked from the :ref:`common-autopilots` page. For example, if "
"an output is configured for DShot in a group, then you cannot use another "
"output in that group for Normal PWM ESC **or** normal PWM servo operation."
msgstr ""
"共享同一定时器的一组输出必须使用相同的高级配置。通常，这些信息会在 :ref:`common-autopilots` "
"页面链接的飞控硬件描述中说明。例如，若某组内的某个输出配置为 DShot，则该组内的其他输出不能用于普通 PWM 电调**或**普通 PWM 舵机操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:147
#: 1209483dd4cc404d9a8a520229c364dc
msgid ""
"Everytime the autopilot initializes, it sends a message to the ground "
"control station, showing which outputs are PWM/Oneshot/or DShot. The "
"remaining higher numbered outputs are assigned as GPIOs."
msgstr "每次飞控初始化时，它会向地面站发送一条消息，显示哪些输出为 PWM/Oneshot/或 DShot。其余编号较大的输出被分配为 GPIO。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:155
#: 2b4384d9ac7d49c5bdd9cf6bf394ab8b
